  "description": "Closed vocabulary for SimReady semantic labels (SemanticsLabelsAPI), following the convention of NVIDIA SimReady assets: each object class is authored on its highest prim as its Wikidata Q-code under 'wikidata_qcode' (SimReady SL.003 / SL.QCODE.001) and its Wikidata English label under 'wikidata_class'. Rendered Material prims get 'material' labels (SL.MAT.001). Prims or materials that already carry labels (for example SimReady assets) are left as they are. Q-codes are checked against wikidata.org by tools/semantic_labeler/verify_qcodes.py.",
